---
# Gift cards, overhaul v3 (WS5; new page, blueprint 2 "ADD"; art direction 3.7): Warm Gallery,
# type only, one ink primary to the shop's Square order page (decisions-and-rules: the link to use
# everywhere) and a 13 px line saying it opens Square. Gift cards are only ever sold; no amount,
# term or expiry is stated (none is recorded). The studio never touches payments: this is a link
# out, nothing more. Wording: _data/pages/gift_cards.json. JSON-LD: gift-cards.11tydata.js.
layout: layouts/v3.njk
theme: warm
permalink: gift-cards.html
slug: gift-cards
page_key: gift_cards
og_image: logo.png
bundles: ["service"]
---
{%- import "v3-service/blocks.njk" as b with context -%}
{%- set pg = pages.gift_cards -%}
{%- set V = pg.v3 -%}
<section class="ws5-hero ws5-hero--page ws5-hero--solo bg-paper-2" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
  <div class="ws5-hero__in">
    <div class="ws5-hero__copy">
      <p class="t-eyebrow">{{ V.eyebrow | safe }}</p>
      <h1 id="hero-h">{{ V.h1 | safe }}</h1>
      <p class="t-lead fg-2 measure">{{ V.lede | safe }}</p>
      {#- Peak pass R1 (psychology 10): buying a card online is this page's job, so it is the page's one filled
          button. Peak pass R2 (CEO ruling, decisions-and-rules line 74: gold fills sit on dark grounds only):
          it keeps the page-primary class, and part A's light-ground primary (30-actions.css, token
          --cta-light-bg) turns .ws5-btn--gold on this cream ground into the ink fill with paper text, never
          gold. data-gold-fill and data-gold-zone keep it the page's one filled control (30-actions.js
          oneGold, 20-header.js). -#}
      <div class="ws5-hero__act"><a class="ws5-btn ws5-btn--gold" href="{{ pg.order_url | safe }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-ev="gift_card_click" data-gold-fill data-gold-zone>{{ V.buy | safe }}</a></div>
      <p class="t-label fg-2">{{ V.buy_note | safe }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--minor bg-paper" aria-labelledby="shop-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="shop-h">{{ V.shop_h2 | safe }}</h2>
    <p class="t-body measure ws5-mt-24">{{ V.shop_text | safe }}<br>{{ site.address.display | safe }}</p>
    {#- Peak pass R2 (psychology R1 #10): the holiday closures, printed only from site.json closures (owner
        confirmed, decisions-and-rules line 62) by 60-moments.js for the next 60 days; nothing prints
        without JavaScript or when no closure is ahead. -#}
    <p class="t-body measure ws5-mt-24 ws5-closures" data-closures data-days="60" data-intro="{{ V.closures_intro }}" data-fact="{{ pages.sections.talk.closed_fact }}" hidden></p>
    <p class="t-body measure fg-2 ws5-mt-8">{{ V.online_any_day | safe }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.talk({ id: "quote", source: "Gift cards", service: "any", uid: "talk", mood: "warm" }) }}
